        <description>Develop executive decision-making, strategic marketing, financial acumen, and enterprise leadership skills.</description>
        <overview>The Bachelor of Management Studies (BMS) programme equips students with foundational principles of corporate management, financial strategy, organizational behavior, and modern marketing analytics. The course prepares future business leaders through experiential case studies, live corporate projects, and leadership workshops.</overview>
        
        <!-- Curriculum Nodes -->
